OL,3,ATrump pledges $5,000 to every American
OL,4,A- and other takeaways from Republican
OL,5,Amidterms convention
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Donald Trump, whose grip over
OL,8,Fthe party remains absolute, delivered a
OL,9,Flengthy keynote speech on Wednesday
OL,10,Fduring the opening night of the two-day
OL,11,Fevent. He covered many of the subjects
OL,12,Fhe has returned to time and again this
OL,13,Fyear - with a few surprises thrown in.
OL,15,FHere are the key takeaways from his
OL,16,Faddress.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
